rl":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-04T04:46:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:46:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/pulls/210","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/210","diff_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/210.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/210.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #207\n\n### Changes\n- `gh issue|pr list|view --json` now asks for `assignees` and `reviewRequests` (teams by `slug`; older disk caches default to empty via `#[serde(default)]`)\n- List rows: the assignees follow the title as `@alice`; a PR row adds the reviewers still to review as `→ bob` (DarkGray, before the review badge / `[draft]`)\n- Detail header: a third line `Assignees: alice, bob   Reviewers: carol`, only when someone is named\n- `/` in the lists matches assignees too (`/@alice`)\n- New `src/github/panes/people.rs` (row spans / header line / search text, with tests); `types.rs` gains a deserialization test for gh's user / team / old-cache shapes\n- Fixtures re-recorded (the `--json` arguments changed) and both GitHub GIFs re-recorded (follow-up commit)\n- README / README.ja / guide `views-github` (en / ja)\n\n### Notes\n- GitHub drops a review request once that person reviews, so the arrow names exactly who has yet to look; submitted reviews stay in the Reviews sub-pane\n- #207 / #208 / #209 are assigned to td72 so the demo shows assignees; no reviewer appears in the GIFs (this repository has no second user) — covered by tests instead\n- Still read-only\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01GYXczwb9NyKFQNMJF7ukp2\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/210/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/210/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]
